  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_8390.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El zumba ha protagonizado la tarde del lunes en las fiestas de agosto de Tales, con Sheila Aguilar Vizca&iacute;no dirigiendo una master class en la plaza de la Iglesia, donde se hab&iacute;a trasladado la actividad desde la plaza Mayor por el fuerte sol.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8373.jpg\" alt=\"img_8373\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8374.jpg\" alt=\"img_8374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8375.jpg\" alt=\"img_8375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8376.jpg\" alt=\"img_8376\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8377.jpg\" alt=\"img_8377\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8378.jpg\" alt=\"img_8378\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8379.jpg\" alt=\"img_8379\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8381.jpg\" alt=\"img_8381\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbatalesfestesagost15/img_8382.jpg\" alt=\"img_8382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2